{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golf Island</strong> is a casual arcade golf game where every round brings something new. Enjoy <strong>randomly generated levels</strong> that are created uniquely each time you play, ensuring no two courses are ever the same. You can also challenge yourself and friends on <strong>seed-based courses</strong>, where the same seed generates identical levels, perfect for comparing scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomly Generated &amp; Seed-Based Levels</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every course is dynamically created with endless variety. Play entirely random courses or share a <strong>seed-based course</strong> with friends to compete on the same layout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415790/extras/2608e29805cc716309457e9b92a9bf67.poster.avif?t=1740766254\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415790/extras/2608e29805cc716309457e9b92a9bf67.webm?t=1740766254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415790/extras/2608e29805cc716309457e9b92a9bf67.mp4?t=1740766254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Game Modes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tee off on a classic  golf course with increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep playing with dynamically generated courses that adapt to keep the challenge fresh.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual Arcade Fun</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy-to-learn controls make it the perfect game to pick up and play anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant, Dynamic Courses</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in beautifully designed environments that keep the experience exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to hit the links like never before in <strong>Golf Island</strong>\u2014where the fun never stops, and the competition is just a round away!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Champion!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415790/29915b0c9a358f138a05a2f5789827ba33bd57b7.jpg"},{"name":"Golf Marathon!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415790/29915b0c9a358f138a05a2f5789827ba33bd57b7.jpg"},{"name":"Classic Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415790/29915b0c9a358f138a05a2f5789827ba33bd57b7.jpg"},{"name":"Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415790/29915b0c9a358f138a05a2f5789827ba33bd57b7.jpg"},{"name":"Globetrotter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415790/29915b0c9a358f138a05a2f5789827ba33bd57b7.jpg"},{"name":"Bonk!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415790/29915b0c9a358f138a05a2f5789827ba33bd57b7.jpg"},{"name":"One and Done!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415790/29915b0c9a358f138a05a2f5789827ba33bd57b7.jpg"},{"name":"Master of the Greens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415790/29915b0c9a358f138a05a2f5789827ba33bd57b7.jpg"},{"name":"Ball's Gone!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415790/29915b0c9a358f138a05